  "claim_boundary": "Ten development-split scenarios, one per family, Hindi and Hinglish only, on the deployed agent through the chat console. Tool truth is read from the append-only journal, never from the transcript. Development data is visible to the optimiser, so this is a calibrated starting point rather than the reportable campaign baseline; validation and regression remain untouched. The agent is stochastic — dispute_handling failed on one run of this same prompt and passed on the next, so single-run figures at n=10 carry real variance."
